<h3>Finish joining Manchester Makerspace</h3>
<p>Hi <%= first_name %>,</p>
<p>You created an account at Manchester Makerspace recently, and we would love to have you finish joining.</p>
<p>To become a member:</p>
<ol>
  <li>Sign in at <a href="<%= portal_url %>"><%= portal_url %></a> and choose a membership.</li>
  <li>Come to an open house for your orientation and your key fob. <strong>Open house is every Monday from 6 to 8pm.</strong> Schedule: <a href="https://manchestermakerspace.org/calendar">https://manchestermakerspace.org/calendar</a></li>
</ol>
<p>Your membership time starts on the day you receive your fob.</p>
<p>If you have questions, ask in <strong>#discuss-talk-to-the-board</strong> on Slack or reply to this email.</p>
<p>Manchester Makerspace</p>
